{"1985690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Looker", "steam_appid": 1985690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "Explore several charmed locations on a mysterious island replete with over 55 creative puzzles. Over an approximately two-hour playing duration, you will face unique challenges, ponderous ideas, and feebly amusing in-jokes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Looker is a single-player game that respects you as an intelligent player, and it treats your time as... reasonably valuable (I mean, don't let me pull you off solving the Riemann hypothesis or anything). As such, I will level with you here—not every joke will be a hit, but there is no filler material, the puzzles are fun, and, if you really think about it, aren't the real solutions the, uhh... friends we make along the way?", "about_the_game": "Explore several charmed locations on a mysterious island replete with over 55 creative puzzles. Over an approximately two-hour playing duration, you will face unique challenges, ponderous ideas, and feebly amusing in-jokes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Looker is a single-player game that respects you as an intelligent player, and it treats your time as... reasonably valuable (I mean, don't let me pull you off solving the Riemann hypothesis or anything). As such, I will level with you here—not every joke will be a hit, but there is no filler material, the puzzles are fun, and, if you really think about it, aren't the real solutions the, uhh... friends we make along the way?", "short_description": "You wake up, alone, on a strangely familiar island full of puzzles that will frustrate and annoy you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985690/header.jpg?t=1663378276", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1985690/capsule_231x87.jpg?